{
    "title": "Spades",
    "description": "Get the experience of classic trick-taking Spades card game. Combine the elements of strategy, skill, and teamwork to make this card game captivating and challenging. Play smart with every hand, win multiple rounds and dominate the table with your partner. \r\n\r\nSpades is a popular card game with the easiest rules. This simple card game is perfect for beginners or anyone with not a lot of experience in card games. Just bid on how many tricks you think your team can take, and outplay your opponents to win.\r\n\r\nHow to Play Spades\r\n\r\nBidding\r\n\r\nThe game starts by dealing each player 13 cards. Each player take turns bidding on how many tricks they can win. A duo is formed with the bot across the player, and their bids combine to form a total bid to win. \r\n\r\nWinning Hands \r\n\r\nA player starts the game by throwing any card on the table. To win the trick, another player should proceed by throwing a card of the same suit with higher number. If the player does not have any card of the same suit, they can throw any card including a trump card, which is any card from the spade suit. \r\n\r\nIf all the same suits are played, the player with the highest number from a suit wins. When a trump card is played, the player with the highest number of the trump card wins the hand. \r\n\r\nThe card is ranked highest to lowest as: A, K, Q, J, 10, 9, 8, 7, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2\r\n\r\nTotal Points\r\n\r\nChoose 250 or 500 as a score to win in Spades. With every trick won, the players gains 10 points and reaches closer to meeting the bid set as a duo. When a round is completed, the duo with the most bids set and achieved gathers more points. The duo that achieves the winning score points first wins the game. \r\n\r\nGame Features \r\n\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Get help setting your bid with our auto bidder feature.\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Choose from a variety of card backs and suit designs.\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Complete exciting missions to earn huge rewards.\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Win games to unlock new levels and challenges.\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Improve your skills for free in the practice arena.\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Enjoy a quick game of Spades anywhere, even without internet.\r\n\r\nIf you love card games like Callbreak, Marriage, Rummy, Solitaire, Indian Rummy, you will love Spades. Strategize wisely and challenge yourself with this classic card game. Beat the bots, win all hands, and gain points to unlock interesting levels. \r\n\r\nDo you have any feedback or complaint? Please send us your thoughts on support@yarsalabs.com. We appreciate your reviews as it helps us make our games better. Thank you, and keep on playing Spades! \r\n\r\nWant to stay updated with Yarsa Games? Follow us on our social medias: \r\n\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/yarsagames/\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/YarsaGames/\r\nTwitter/X: https://x.com/Yarsagames",
